advancing the service

01:38:33.270 --> 01:38:36.660
that's offered, but also
creating value in the community

01:38:36.660 --> 01:38:39.120
and creating jobs for
people in the community.

01:38:39.120 --> 01:38:44.120
So it was really helpful for
me just to get a visual picture

01:38:45.330 --> 01:38:46.830
of what some of the words

01:38:46.830 --> 01:38:48.720
that you've set out in this report are

01:38:48.720 --> 01:38:51.990
and just how important
